<title>RUSSIA: Russian 6-mth T-bill yield rises to 56.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian 6-mth T-bill yield rises to 56.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on an issue of six-month GKO discount Treasury bills rose to 56.00 percent at an auction on Wednesday from 49.63 percent at the previous auction on October 9, the central bank said.</p>
